a:3:{s:4:"time";i:1751705523;s:3:"ttl";i:0;s:4:"data";s:28373:"  <div class="card"><div class="card-header" role="tab" id="section1HeaderId"><a data-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="true" data-parent="#in-the-news-accordion" href="#section1ContentId" aria-controls="accordion-1 .item-1"><h5 class="mb-0 intro-body"> 2025<i class="fa fa-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></h5></a></div><div id="section1ContentId" class="collapse show item-1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="section1HeaderId"><div class="row">  <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsBusWorld_02052025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsBusWorld_02052025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">How Consumer Durables Brands Nail Summer Marketing</h6><h6 class="card-text">As temperatures soar, so do marketing opportunities. Summer has long been the busiest  season for consumer durable brands and air conditioners in particular see a surge in deman.</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">Business World, May 2025</h6> <a href="https://www.voltas.in/images/publications/HowConsumerDurablesBrandsNailSummerMarketing.pdf" target=_blank><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i></a> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsStoryboard_25042025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsStoryboard_25042025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">Inside CTV&#8217;s explosion: How brands are leveraging immersive storytelling and data</h6><h6 class="card-text">Marketers often face a critical trade-off: TV's mass reach at efficient costs versus CTV's targeted reach at higher costs, some settle for one of the two while others attempt to strike a balance. </h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">Storyboard 18, April 2025</h6> <a href="https://www.storyboard18.com/how-it-works/inside-ctvs-explosion-how-brands-are-leveraging-immersive-storytelling-and-data-62756.htm" target=_blank><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i></a> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsThermal_17042025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsThermal_17042025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">Water-Cooled HVAC &amp; Sustainable Cooling Solutions | Kishore Chandrasekharan | Voltas | ACREX 2025</h6><h6 class="card-text">Discover how Voltas is driving innovation in commercial air conditioning with advancements in compressor technology, BLDC motors, & water-cooled systems. In this exclusive conversation, Kishore Chandrasekharan, Head of Commercial Air Conditioning at Voltas</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">Thermal Control, April 2025</h6> <a href="https://www.thermalcontrolmagazine.com/aiovg_videos/water-cooled-hvac-sustainable-cooling-solutions-kishore-chandrasekharan-voltas-acrex-2025/" target=_blank><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i></a> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsKarnavati_11042025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsKarnavati_11042025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">Voltas Opened Five New Offline Stores In a week</h6><h6 class="card-text">Voltas Limited, India’s No. 1 AC company, from the house of Tata’s launched five new and exclusive brand stores across Maharashtra, Gujarat, West Bengal and Andhra Pradesh, last week. </h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">Karnavati Express Ahmedabad, April 2025</h6> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsDeccan_11042025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsDeccan_11042025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">Sweat and The City</h6><h6 class="card-text">There is an urgent need for comprehensive heat mitigation in India's cities, some states could face 10-11 days of heatwave</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">Deccan Chronicle Chennai, April 2025</h6> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsBWMarketing_10042025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsBWMarketing_10042025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">India’s ACs Sale Surge On Heat Waves  BW Online Bureau  Mar 30, 2025</h6><h6 class="card-text">India’s air conditioning manufacturers are anticipating a surge in sales as record temperatures and predictions of further heat increase the need for cooling units. </h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">BW Marketing, March 2025</h6> <a href="https://www.bwmarketingworl