el-air-conditioner-sales-defying-consumer-slowdown-12978620.html" target=_blank><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i></a> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newse4m_10042025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newse4m_10042025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">Marketing heats up for cooling brands as ad spends rise 15-20% ahead of peak summer &nbsp;  &nbsp;  &nbsp;  &nbsp;  &nbsp;  &nbsp;  &nbsp;  &nbsp;  &nbsp;  &nbsp;  &nbsp; </h6><h6 class="card-text">As the summer kicks in, cooling appliances brands are turning up their marketing game to stay ahead in the summer rush. From high-voltage ad campaigns and celebrity endorsements to massive discounts and tech-driven innovations, air conditioners (AC), fans,</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">e4m, March 2025</h6> <a href="https://www.exchange4media.com/marketing-news/marketing-heats-up-for-cooling-brands-as-spends-rise-15-20-ahead-of-peak-summer-142115.html" target=_blank><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i></a> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsMoneyControl_18032025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsMoneyControl_18032025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">Cooling industry warms up for a scorching summer</h6><h6 class="card-text">Leading consumer durables companies have amped up dealer-level stocking in the January-March quarter, anticipating a hot summer and aiming to prevent last year’s supply shortages when demand outpaced supply.</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">Money Control, March 2025</h6> <a href="https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/cooling-industry-warms-up-for-a-scorching-summer-12948620.html" target=_blank><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i></a> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsBestMedia_10042025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsBestMedia_10042025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">Summer heatwave fuels double-digit ad spend rise for cooling giants</h6><h6 class="card-text">The summer heat is at our doorstep. As temperatures soar, the intense heatwave is not only transforming the environment but also igniting fierce marketing battles among cooling brands. </h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">Best Media Info, March 2025</h6> <a href="https://bestmediainfo.com/special/in-depth/summer-heatwave-fuels-double-digit-ad-spend-rise-for-cooling-giants-8887519" target=_blank><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i></a> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsTelegraph_10042025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsTelegraph_10042025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">AC sales to surge with heat</h6><h6 class="card-text">Demand for room air conditioners is set to soar as the industry gears up for a scorching summer.</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">The Telegraph Kolkata, March 2025</h6> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsThermalControl_18032025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsThermalControl_18032025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">Energy efficient Green products offerings for varied HVAC applications</h6><h6 class="card-text">Voltas Limited, India’s Premier AC company from the house of Tata is recognized for its excellence in in-room air conditioning, commercial air-conditioning solutions, and commercial refrigeration.</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">Thermal Control Business Update, March 2025</h6> <a href="https://www.thermalcontrolmagazine.com/acrex-2025/energy-efficient-green-products-offerings-for-varied-hvac-applications/" target=_blank><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i></a> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newshindustan_10042025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newshindustan_10042025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">A Journey into Innovation: Winners Explore the Future of Kitchen Technology with Voltas Beko</h6><h6 class="card-text">Voltas Beko provides a space where technology meets creativity and where people, especially women, are shaping the future of Indian manufacturing. </h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">Hindustan Times, March 2025</h6> <a href="https://www.hindustantimes.com/genesis/a-journey-into-innovation-winners-explore-the-future-of-kitchen-technology-with-voltas-beko-101742299467092.html" target=_blank><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i></a> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsETNow_18032025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsETNow_18032025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">Keeping India’s Digital Engine Cool: How AC makers like Blue Star, Voltas are leading the charge</h6><h6 class="card-text">India is witnessing an unprecedented surge in its demand for air conditioning , driven by rapid urbanization, infrastructure expansion, and an increasingly digital economy.</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">ET Now, March 2025</h6> <a href="https://www.etnownews.com/news/keeping-indias-digital-engine-cool-how-ac-makers-like-blue-star-voltas-are-leading-the-charge-article-118483608" target=_blank><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i></a> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsFinExp_10042025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsFinExp_10042025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">Consumer durable firms see a bumper summer</h6><h6 class="card-text">The Blistering Heat maybe inconvenient for people but durable firms are cheering the early onset of summer this year.</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">Financial Express New Delhi, March 2025</h6> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsRepublic_18032025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsRepublic_18032025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">4 Enticing Dishes To Celebrate International Women’s Day 2025</h6><h6 class="card-text">As the much-anticipated day of the year arrives, i.e. 8 March - International Women's Day, let's take this moment to celebrate the women in our lives with delicious recipes that are as easy to make as they are enjoyable.</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">Republic World, March 2025</h6> <a href="https://www.republicworld.com/lifestyle/food/4-enticing-dishes-to-celebrate-international-womens-day-2025-check-out-menus-from-starter-to-dessert-for-house-parties" target=_blank><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i></a> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsThermalControl02_18032025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsThermalControl02_18032025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">Voltas presents commercial refrigeration products at AAHAR 2025</h6><h6 class="card-text">Voltas Limited, from the Tata House, displays its energy-efficient commercial refrigeration products at AAHAR 2025. With quality and cutting-edge solutions, the company is helping businesses reduce operating costs, improve their environmental impact</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">Thermal Control Busines Update, March 2025</h6> <a href="https://www.thermalcontrolmagazine.com/event-update/voltas-presents-commercial-refrigeration-products-at-aahar-2025/" target=_blank><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i></a> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsTOIMumbai_18032025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsTOIMumbai_18032025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">AC prices heat up on weak Re, supply woes</h6><h6 class="card-text">Temperatures are soaring, so are AC prices. AC makers are facing a double whammy ahead of the peak business season - weakening rupee has inflated import bills & supply chain contraints which have delayed shipments of key AC components like compressors.</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">The Times of India Mumbai, February 2025</h6> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsHinduBusiness_18032025.jpg" data-featherlight="image"><img src="https://devvoltas.voltasworld.com/images/publications/newsHinduBusiness_18032025.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="..."></a></div><div class="card-body"><h6 class="card-title">Room AC use may go up sharply: Voltas</h6><h6 class="card-text">Room air conditioner (RAC) penetration in India is expected to rise from less than 10% to around 50-60% over the next 10-15 years, driving exponential demand, according to Mukundan Menon, Executive Director & Head of the RAC Business at Voltas</h6><h6 class="card-overtitle">The Hindu Business Line Mumbai, February 2025</h6> </div></div></div>      <div class="col-12 col-md-4 d-flex"><div class="card voltas-card voltas-card-news bg-slate-light_4 w-100"><div class="card-image-wrapper"> <a class="model-lightbox" href="htt